we're testing out the Ty-Lite.

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.172
(funky music)

00:00:26.172 --> 00:00:27.891
- I used to think that selfies were dumb,

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:30.022
but now I kind of get it.

00:00:30.027 --> 00:00:32.785
- I have grown to love
and respect selfies.

00:00:32.785 --> 00:00:34.921
- I feel like selfies get such a bad rap,

00:00:34.921 --> 00:00:37.009
like anyone taking a selfie is considered

00:00:37.009 --> 00:00:38.657
narcissistic or super into themselves.

00:00:38.657 --> 00:00:40.377
