magazine about why selfies

00:00:42.837 --> 00:00:45.161
are like ruining the
millennial generation,

00:00:45.161 --> 00:00:46.735
I'm going to lose my mind.

00:00:46.761 --> 00:00:47.760
- I think it's cool that people feel

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.989
confident enough to be like,

00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:51.013
"Here I am, here's my look, I feel cute,"

00:00:51.013 --> 00:00:52.491
like, "Hello world!"

00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:54.448
- If you're comfortable
with posting selfies,

00:00:54.448 --> 00:00:55.700
I say go for it.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.270
This it it.

00:00:58.692 --> 00:00:59.900
- I like how to says Ty-Lite

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.030
